---
import { Image, getImage } from 'astro:assets';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import RecognitionSection from '../components/RecognitionSection.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import historyImage from '../assets/photos/tribute-history.jpg';
import fiftyYearsImage from '../assets/photos/tribute-50-years.jpg';
import uluru from '../assets/photos/uluru.jpg';

const uluruBg = await getImage({ src: uluru, width: 1920, format: 'webp' });
---
<Base title="Indigenous Tribute" description="NWCR is committed to making a difference through mentoring, traineeships and long-term careers for Indigenous people.">
  <PageHeader title="Indigenous tribute" eyebrow="Supporting our people" />

  <section class="py-20 sm:py-28">
    <div class="container-x grid items-start gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.4fr_1fr] lg:gap-16">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Our commitment</p>
        <h2 class="section-title mt-2">Committed to making a difference</h2>
        <div class="prose-nwcr mt-6 text-lg">
          <p>
            We can offer the opportunity for individuals to work with subject matter experts and industry leaders in their field,
            which then creates opportunities for our people to take on coaching and mentoring roles. We believe one of our strengths
            is project management, so we would like to build opportunities where we can work with other Indigenous businesses to
            deliver a complete service for our customers and deliver on our commitments.
          </p>
          <p>
            We believe from our experience we can provide a workplace that keeps our people interested, by being transparent with our
            planning process and keeping them informed. The team will always know how we are tracking with our commitments, and will
            have the opportunity to assist in continuous improvement when under pressure. There will be opportunities for
            individuals to move into other areas such as safety, environment, training or leadership roles, again making them more
            employable and building on skills that are in demand.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="my-8 border-l-4 border-ochre bg-sand p-6 sm:p-8">
          <p class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-wide text-navy-900 uppercase">We have developed a traineeship program</p>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-ink/80">
            It allows young, unskilled individuals to enter the workforce and be placed with a mentor and role model, to demonstrate
            that through hard work and dedication they can make a difference and achieve. This builds confidence and trust, which
            achieves great results for everyone involved, including the community.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="prose-nwcr text-lg">
          <p>
            <strong class="text-navy-900">We are committed to making a difference</strong>, offering employment opportunities that
            develop our staff, build on their strengths and create an attitude where safety comes first, hand in hand with
            delivering on commitments. Our vision is to prepare, coach and mentor our people to succeed and help us collectively
            achieve company goals and benchmarks.
          </p>
          <p>
            The rail industry demands a variety of highly skilled people, whom we hope to mentor and educate to establish long-term
            employment for themselves as well as the community. We endeavour to create career opportunities for these people, not
            just transitional work opportunities.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <Image src={historyImage} alt="Historic photograph of the 1968 Torres Strait Islander track-laying gang" widths={[480, 720]} sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 35vw, 100vw" class="w-full rounded-sm shadow-xl lg:sticky lg:top-28" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="relative isolate overflow-hidden py-20 sm:py-28">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-cover bg-center" style={`background-image:url(${uluruBg.src})`}></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-gradient-to-r from-navy-950/85 via-navy-950/60 to-navy-950/20"></div>
    <div class="container-x grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow text-brand-light">Voice. Treaty. Truth.</p>
        <h2 class="section-title mt-2 text-white">The Uluru Statement</h2>
        <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-white/85">We support the Uluru Statement from the Heart.</p>
        <a href="https://ulurustatement.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-primary mt-8">
          Find out more at ulurustatement.org <Icon name="arrow" class="size-4" />
        </a>
      </div>
      <Image src={fiftyYearsImage} alt="Workers and families at the 50-year anniversary celebration in Port Hedland" widths={[480, 720]} sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 50vw, 100vw" class="w-full rounded-sm bg-white shadow-2xl" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <RecognitionSection />
</Base>
